                "_type": "Diesel Product Detail",
                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-stubbsthezombieinrebelwithoutapulse-aspyr-s2-1200x1600-32b6bfdc676e.jpg",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "Aspyr",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "Aspyr",
                    "description": "## Be the Zombie. Kick A** and Take Brains\n\nIt’s 1959 and the city of Punchbowl, PA, is a beacon of progress and ideal living. Show the living that law and order are no match for a dead man on a mission. Your boyfriend’s back Maggie, and Punchbowl is gonna be in trouble!\n\n![stubbs_tutorial.jpg](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-stubbsthezombieinrebelwithoutapulse-aspyr-g2-00-1920x1080-28ff7abe34a8.jpg)\n\n## Eat Brains\n\nChomp on the living and replenish your bodily arsenal of: zombie sputum, gut grenades, and the stunning unholy flatulence\n\n![stubbs_farm.jpg](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-stubbsthezombieinrebelwithoutapulse-aspyr-g2-01-1920x1080-fc0a6c65acde.jpg)\n\n## Possess Punchbowl’s Population\n\nClamp your severed hand to a barbershop quartet singer’s head and raygun away\n\n![stubbs_police.jpg](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-stubbsthezombieinrebelwithoutapulse-aspyr-g2-02-1920x1080-98ae2a5eaad2.jpg)\n\n## Build Your Zombie Horde\n\nConvert your enemies into undead allies & lead a zombie assault on the living\n\n![stubbs_dam.jpg](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-stubbsthezombieinrebelwithoutapulse-aspyr-g2-03-1920x1080-32cb8f5664d7.jpg)\n\n## Bring Civilization to its Knees\n\nShow the retro-futuristic city of Punchbowl, PA that they can’t escape the past\n\n![stubbs_military.jpg](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-stubbsthezombieinrebelwithoutapulse-aspyr-g2-04-1920x1080-16b54984dd5b.jpg)\n\n## Stubbs and Chill\n\nInvite a friend to play as Grubbs for classic couch cooperative hijinks. (Friend not included)\n\n![co_stareoff.jpg](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-stubbsthezombieinrebelwithoutapulse-aspyr-g2-05-1920x1080-98e5682a95bc.jpg)",
                    "shortDescription": "Be the Zombie. Kick A** and Take Brains. It’s 1959 and the city of Punchbowl, PA, is a beacon of progress and ideal living. Show the living that law and order are no match for a dead man on a mission!",
                    "title": "Stubbs the Zombie in Rebel Without a Pulse",
